// actions/inventory.baga — заприхождаване и изписване (WAC / FIFO / LIFO).
// Изписване: Дт приходна (702) / Кт складова (304) по себестойност.

import "../models/product.baga"
import "../models/inventory.baga"
import "ormbaga/orm.baga"
import "bagadecimal/src/decimal.baga"
import "std/str/str.baga"

struct InvResult {
    ok: i64,
    err: str,
    db: OrmDb,
    cost: str
}

fn inv_ok(db: OrmDb, cost: str) -> InvResult {
    return InvResult { ok: 1, err: "", db: db, cost: cost }
}

fn inv_err(db: OrmDb, err: str) -> InvResult {
    return InvResult { ok: 0, err: err, db: db, cost: "0" }
}

fn inv_dec_or_zero(s: str) -> Decimal {
    let p = dec_parse(s)
    if p.ok == 0 {
        return dec_zero()
    }
    return p.value
}

fn inv_money(d: Decimal) -> str {
    let r = dec_round_dp(d, 2)
    if r.ok == 0 {
        return dec_to_string(d)
    }
    return dec_to_string(r.value)
}

fn inv_qty(d: Decimal) -> str {
    let r = dec_round_dp(d, 4)
    if r.ok == 0 {
        return dec_to_string(d)
    }
    return dec_to_string(r.value)
}

fn inv_mul(a: Decimal, b: Decimal) -> DecResult {
    return dec_mul(a, b)
}

// Заприхождаване: партида + средна цена / наличност.
fn inv_receive(db: OrmDb, product_id: i64, invoice_id: i64, invoice_line_id: i64, received_date: str, qty_s: str, unit_cost_s: str, location_id: i64) -> InvResult !IO !Net {
    let pq = product_find(db, product_id)?
    if orm_ok_q(pq) == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), orm_err_q(pq))
    }
    if orm_nrows(pq) < 1 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), "артикулът не е намерен")
    }
    if orm_cell_by_i64(pq, 0, "is_inventory") == 0 {
        return inv_ok(orm_db_q(pq), "0")
    }
    let qty = inv_dec_or_zero(qty_s)
    if dec_cmp(qty, dec_zero()) <= 0 {
        return inv_ok(orm_db_q(pq), "0")
    }
    let unit_cost = inv_dec_or_zero(unit_cost_s)
    let line = inv_mul(qty, unit_cost)
    if line.ok == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), line.err)
    }
    let old_qty = inv_dec_or_zero(orm_cell_by(pq, 0, "stock_quantity"))
    let old_val = inv_dec_or_zero(orm_cell_by(pq, 0, "stock_value"))
    let new_qty_r = dec_add(old_qty, qty)
    if new_qty_r.ok == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), new_qty_r.err)
    }
    let new_val_r = dec_add(old_val, line.value)
    if new_val_r.ok == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), new_val_r.err)
    }
    let mut avg = unit_cost
    if dec_cmp(new_qty_r.value, dec_zero()) > 0 {
        let d = dec_div(new_val_r.value, new_qty_r.value)
        if d.ok == 1 {
            avg = d.value
        }
    }
    let mut db2 = orm_db_q(pq)
    let ins = lot_insert(db2, product_id, invoice_id, invoice_line_id, received_date, inv_qty(qty), inv_qty(qty), dec_to_string(unit_cost), location_id)?
    if orm_ok(ins) == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_exec(ins), orm_err_exec(ins))
    }
    db2 = orm_db_exec(ins)
    let su = product_set_stock(db2, product_id, inv_qty(new_qty_r.value), inv_money(new_val_r.value), dec_to_string(avg))?
    if orm_ok(su) == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_exec(su), orm_err_exec(su))
    }
    return inv_ok(orm_db_exec(su), inv_money(line.value))
}

// Изписване по метод: WAC (среднопретеглена), FIFO, LIFO.
fn inv_lot_at(q: OrmQuery, row: i64, location_id: i64) -> i64 {
    if orm_cell_by_i64(q, row, "location_id") == location_id {
        return 1
    }
    return 0
}

fn inv_qty_at(q: OrmQuery, location_id: i64) -> Decimal {
    let mut sum = dec_zero()
    let mut i: i64 = 0
    while i < orm_nrows(q) {
        if inv_lot_at(q, i, location_id) == 1 {
            let rem = inv_dec_or_zero(orm_cell_by(q, i, "quantity_remaining"))
            let a = dec_add(sum, rem)
            if a.ok == 1 {
                sum = a.value
            }
        }
        i = i + 1
    }
    return sum
}

fn inv_issue(db: OrmDb, product_id: i64, qty_s: str, method: str, product_name: str, location_id: i64) -> InvResult !IO !Net {
    let pq = product_find(db, product_id)?
    if orm_ok_q(pq) == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), orm_err_q(pq))
    }
    if orm_nrows(pq) < 1 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), "артикулът не е намерен")
    }
    if orm_cell_by_i64(pq, 0, "is_inventory") == 0 {
        return inv_ok(orm_db_q(pq), "0")
    }
    let qty = inv_dec_or_zero(qty_s)
    if dec_cmp(qty, dec_zero()) <= 0 {
        return inv_ok(orm_db_q(pq), "0")
    }
    let stock_qty = inv_dec_or_zero(orm_cell_by(pq, 0, "stock_quantity"))
    if dec_cmp(stock_qty, qty) < 0 {
        let msg = concat(concat(concat("недостатъчна наличност за ", product_name), " (налично "), concat(orm_cell_by(pq, 0, "stock_quantity"), concat(", нужно ", qty_s)))
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), concat(msg, ")"))
    }
    let stock_val = inv_dec_or_zero(orm_cell_by(pq, 0, "stock_value"))
    let mut db2 = orm_db_q(pq)
    if method == "FIFO" || method == "LIFO" {
        return inv_issue_lots(db2, product_id, qty, stock_qty, stock_val, method, location_id)?
    }
    // WAC — среднопретеглена: себестойност = к-во × средна цена.
    let mut unit = dec_zero()
    if dec_cmp(stock_qty, dec_zero()) > 0 {
        let d = dec_div(stock_val, stock_qty)
        if d.ok == 1 {
            unit = d.value
        }
    }
    let cost_r = inv_mul(qty, unit)
    if cost_r.ok == 0 {
        return inv_err(db2, cost_r.err)
    }
    let mut cost = cost_r.value
    let new_qty_r = dec_sub(stock_qty, qty)
    if new_qty_r.ok == 0 {
        return inv_err(db2, new_qty_r.err)
    }
    let mut new_val = dec_zero()
    if dec_cmp(new_qty_r.value, dec_zero()) <= 0 {
        cost = stock_val
        new_val = dec_zero()
    } else {
        let nv = dec_sub(stock_val, cost)
        if nv.ok == 0 {
            return inv_err(db2, nv.err)
        }
        new_val = nv.value
    }
    let taken = inv_take_lots(db2, product_id, location_id, qty, 0, 0, "")?
    if taken.ok == 0 {
        if location_id > 0 {
            return taken
        }
    } else {
        db2 = taken.db
    }
    let su = product_set_stock(db2, product_id, inv_qty(new_qty_r.value), inv_money(new_val), dec_to_string(unit))?
    if orm_ok(su) == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_exec(su), orm_err_exec(su))
    }
    return inv_ok(orm_db_exec(su), inv_money(cost))
}

fn inv_issue_lots(db: OrmDb, product_id: i64, qty: Decimal, stock_qty: Decimal, stock_val: Decimal, method: str, location_id: i64) -> InvResult !IO !Net {
    let lq = lot_by_product(db, product_id)?
    if orm_ok_q(lq) == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(lq), orm_err_q(lq))
    }
    let n = orm_nrows(lq)
    let mut need = qty
    let mut cost = dec_zero()
    let mut db2 = orm_db_q(lq)
    let mut step: i64 = 1
    let mut i: i64 = 0
    if method == "LIFO" {
        i = n - 1
        step = -1
    }
    let mut looping: i64 = 1
    if n < 1 {
        looping = 0
    }
    while looping == 1 {
        if method == "LIFO" {
            if i < 0 {
                looping = 0
            }
        } else {
            if i >= n {
                looping = 0
            }
        }
        if looping == 1 {
            if dec_cmp(need, dec_zero()) <= 0 {
                looping = 0
            }
        }
        if looping == 1 {
            let rem = inv_dec_or_zero(orm_cell_by(lq, i, "quantity_remaining"))
            if inv_lot_at(lq, i, location_id) == 1 {
            if dec_cmp(rem, dec_zero()) > 0 {
                let mut take = rem
                if dec_cmp(rem, need) > 0 {
                    take = need
                }
                let uc = inv_dec_or_zero(orm_cell_by(lq, i, "unit_cost"))
                let part = inv_mul(take, uc)
                if part.ok == 0 {
                    return inv_err(db2, part.err)
                }
                let c2 = dec_add(cost, part.value)
                if c2.ok == 0 {
                    return inv_err(db2, c2.err)
                }
                cost = c2.value
                let left_r = dec_sub(rem, take)
                if left_r.ok == 0 {
                    return inv_err(db2, left_r.err)
                }
                let lid = orm_cell_by_i64(lq, i, "id")
                let lu = lot_set_remaining(db2, lid, inv_qty(left_r.value))?
                if orm_ok(lu) == 0 {
                    return inv_err(orm_db_exec(lu), orm_err_exec(lu))
                }
                db2 = orm_db_exec(lu)
                let n2 = dec_sub(need, take)
                if n2.ok == 0 {
                    return inv_err(db2, n2.err)
                }
                need = n2.value
            }
            }
            i = i + step
        }
    }
    if dec_cmp(need, dec_zero()) > 0 {
        return inv_err(db2, "недостатъчни партиди за изписване")
    }
    let new_qty_r = dec_sub(stock_qty, qty)
    if new_qty_r.ok == 0 {
        return inv_err(db2, new_qty_r.err)
    }
    let mut new_val = dec_zero()
    let mut avg = dec_zero()
    if dec_cmp(new_qty_r.value, dec_zero()) <= 0 {
        cost = stock_val
        new_val = dec_zero()
    } else {
        let nv = dec_sub(stock_val, cost)
        if nv.ok == 0 {
            return inv_err(db2, nv.err)
        }
        new_val = nv.value
        let d = dec_div(new_val, new_qty_r.value)
        if d.ok == 1 {
            avg = d.value
        }
    }
    let su = product_set_stock(db2, product_id, inv_qty(new_qty_r.value), inv_money(new_val), dec_to_string(avg))?
    if orm_ok(su) == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_exec(su), orm_err_exec(su))
    }
    return inv_ok(orm_db_exec(su), inv_money(cost))
}

// Вади количество от партиди в обект. Ако do_dest==1, създава партиди в dest
// със същата себестойност (вътрешен трансфер — без фирмен тотал).
fn inv_take_lots(db: OrmDb, product_id: i64, from_location_id: i64, qty: Decimal, dest_location_id: i64, do_dest: i64, received_date: str) -> InvResult !IO !Net {
    let lq = lot_by_product(db, product_id)?
    if orm_ok_q(lq) == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(lq), orm_err_q(lq))
    }
    let at = inv_qty_at(lq, from_location_id)
    if dec_cmp(at, qty) < 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(lq), "недостатъчна наличност в обекта")
    }
    let n = orm_nrows(lq)
    let mut need = qty
    let mut db2 = orm_db_q(lq)
    let mut i: i64 = 0
    while i < n {
        if dec_cmp(need, dec_zero()) > 0 {
            if inv_lot_at(lq, i, from_location_id) == 1 {
                let rem = inv_dec_or_zero(orm_cell_by(lq, i, "quantity_remaining"))
                if dec_cmp(rem, dec_zero()) > 0 {
                    let mut take = rem
                    if dec_cmp(rem, need) > 0 {
                        take = need
                    }
                    let left_r = dec_sub(rem, take)
                    if left_r.ok == 0 {
                        return inv_err(db2, left_r.err)
                    }
                    let lid = orm_cell_by_i64(lq, i, "id")
                    let lu = lot_set_remaining(db2, lid, inv_qty(left_r.value))?
                    if orm_ok(lu) == 0 {
                        return inv_err(orm_db_exec(lu), orm_err_exec(lu))
                    }
                    db2 = orm_db_exec(lu)
                    if do_dest == 1 {
                        let uc = orm_cell_by(lq, i, "unit_cost")
                        let ins = lot_insert(db2, product_id, 0, 0, received_date, inv_qty(take), inv_qty(take), uc, dest_location_id)?
                        if orm_ok(ins) == 0 {
                            return inv_err(orm_db_exec(ins), orm_err_exec(ins))
                        }
                        db2 = orm_db_exec(ins)
                    }
                    let n2 = dec_sub(need, take)
                    if n2.ok == 0 {
                        return inv_err(db2, n2.err)
                    }
                    need = n2.value
                }
            }
        }
        i = i + 1
    }
    if dec_cmp(need, dec_zero()) > 0 {
        return inv_err(db2, "недостатъчна наличност в обекта")
    }
    return inv_ok(db2, inv_qty(qty))
}

fn inv_transfer(db: OrmDb, product_id: i64, qty_s: str, from_location_id: i64, to_location_id: i64, moved_date: str, product_name: str) -> InvResult !IO !Net {
    if from_location_id == to_location_id {
        return inv_err(db, "обектът-източник и обектът-приемник съвпадат")
    }
    let pq = product_find(db, product_id)?
    if orm_ok_q(pq) == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), orm_err_q(pq))
    }
    if orm_nrows(pq) < 1 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), "артикулът не е намерен")
    }
    if orm_cell_by_i64(pq, 0, "is_inventory") == 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), concat(product_name, " не е складов артикул"))
    }
    let qty = inv_dec_or_zero(qty_s)
    if dec_cmp(qty, dec_zero()) <= 0 {
        return inv_err(orm_db_q(pq), "количеството трябва да е положително")
    }
    return inv_take_lots(orm_db_q(pq), product_id, from_location_id, qty, to_location_id, 1, moved_date)?
}
